---
config:
  look: neo
  theme: redux-color
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 18px
  sequence:
    showSequenceNumbers: true
    wrap: false
    messageFontSize: 17
    noteFontSize: 16
    actorFontSize: 18
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Usuário / Administrador
  participant T@{ "type": "boundary" } as DashboardScreen
  participant A@{ "type": "control" } as app.js GET /dashboard
  participant R@{ "type": "entity" } as analyticsRepository.js
  participant D@{ "type": "database" } as PostgreSQL
  Note over U,D: FP = fluxo principal · FA = fluxo alternativo (volta ao principal) · FE = exceção (encerra o caso)
  U->>T: FilterChips onChange={setScope} / {setPeriod} → load()
  T->>A: getDashboard({ scope, days: Number(period) }) → GET /dashboard
  alt FE1 · visão da plataforma sem ser administrador
    A-->>T: 403 { code: 'ADMIN_ONLY' }
    T-->>U: setError(error.message)
  else FP · escopo permitido (meu conteúdo ou plataforma pelo admin)
    A->>R: dashboard({ scope, ownerId: req.auth.sub, since })
    par painéis em paralelo
      R->>D: postsBlock(params)
    and
      R->>D: eventsBlock(params)
    and
      R->>D: ratingsBlock(params)
    and
      R->>R: presentersBlock({ since, ownerId })
    end
    D-->>R: contagens e linhas
    opt FA1 · administrador escolheu a plataforma: indicadores da comunidade
      R->>D: activeUsers, deactivatedUsers, newUsers, openReports
      R->>R: result.community = { ... }
    end
    R-->>A: { scope, posts, events, ratings, presenters, community? }
    A-->>T: 200 { data }
    T-->>U: setData(data) → Tile, HBars, MonthColumns, TopList
    Note over U,T: FA2 · sem dados no período: os painéis mostram zero
  end
